in="3:18.454" end="3:19.889">不再想</span><span begin="3:19.889" end="3:23.118">你</span></p></div><div begin="3:26.073" end="3:54.302" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="3:26.073" end="3:32.102" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:26.073" end="3:27.408">我的勇</span><span begin="3:27.408" end="3:28.250">气</span> <span begin="3:29.477" end="3:29.708">已</span><span begin="3:29.708" end="3:31.085">不言而</span><span begin="3:31.085" end="3:32.102">喻</span></p><p begin="3:33.126" end="3:39.350" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:33.126" end="3:33.277">我</span><span begin="3:33.277" end="3:38.403">学会了将自己从往事中抽</span><span begin="3:38.403" end="3:39.350">离</span></p><p begin="3:40.704" end="3:47.106" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:40.704" end="3:42.071">不再想</span><span begin="3:42.071" end="3:43.100">你</span> <span begin="3:44.066" end="3:44.359">就</span><span begin="3:44.359" end="3:45.705">这么决</span><span begin="3:45.705" end="3:47.106">定</span></p><p begin="3:47.706" end="3:54.302" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:47.706" end="3:48.036">失</span><span begin="3:48.036" end="3:49.800">忆症是一</span><span begin="3:49.800" end="3:50.309">种</span><span begin="3:50.309" end="3:52.422">难得一见的</span><span begin="3:52.422" end="3:53.103">幸</span><span begin="3:53.103" end="3:54.302">运</span></p></div><div begin="3:55.101" end="4:09.750" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="3:55.101" end="3:57.704" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:55.101" end="3:55.355">忘</span><span begin="3:55.355" end="3:55.754">记</span><span begin="3:55.754" end="3:55.954">了</span><span begin="3:56.158" end="3:56.507">你</span><span begin="3:56.507" end="3:56.607">的</span><span begin="3:56.607" end="3:57.704">姓名</span></p><p begin="3:58.707" end="4:01.650" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:58.707" end="3:59.009">忘</span><span begin="3:59.009" end="3:59.451">记</span><span begin="3:59.451" end="3:59.655">了</span><span begin="3:59.755" end="4:00.160">你